<a name="overview"></a>
<h1>SORTA-Clear™ 40</h1>
<div class="info">
	<div class="herothumb">
		<img src="//www.smooth-on.com/pw/site/assets/files/5489/sorta-clear-40-combo-533x400.jpg" alt="SORTA-Clear™ 40" class="" width="533" height="400" />
	<span style="display:block;text-align:right;font-style:italic;font-weight:200;margin-top:-12px;padding-right:12px">*NOTE: Product Packaging May Vary</span>
		<h3 class="gotodocs"><strong class="ctaRedChevron">›</strong> <a href="https://www.smooth-on.com/documents/?doc=all#sorta-clear-40">Technical Bulletin and SDS</a></h3>
		</div>	
	<p><strong>SORTA-Clear™</strong>&nbsp;Series rubbers are premium water clear translucent silicone rubbers (platinum catalyst) which cure at room temperature with negligible shrinkage.&nbsp;This&nbsp;product&nbsp;requires a gram scale for measuring parts A + B.&nbsp;<strong>SORTA-Clear™ 40</strong>&nbsp;comes in Shore 40A hardness and features high tensile and tear strength.</p>

<p><strong>SORTA-Clear™</strong>&nbsp;silicones are ideal for making prototype, jewelry or other molds of any configuration where model visibility is important (i.e. extracting a model from the mold via cutting). Materials such as urethane, epoxy or polyester resins can then be cast into <strong>SORTA-Clear™</strong>&nbsp;silicone without application of a release agent. Other materials such as wax and low melt metal alloys can also be cast into <strong>SORTA-Clear™</strong>. <strong>SORTA-Clear™</strong>&nbsp;can be pigmented with&nbsp;<strong>SILC Pig™&nbsp;</strong>silicone pigments.</p>

<p><strong>SORTA Clear™ 40</strong>&nbsp;silicone rubber is&nbsp;<strong>FOOD SAFE</strong>&nbsp;and can be used for culinary applications including casting chocolate and other confections.</p>

<p><strong>Certified Skin Safe&nbsp;-&nbsp;</strong>Cured<strong>&nbsp;SORTA Clear™ 40&nbsp;</strong>is skin safe and certified by an independent laboratory.</p>

<h3 style="text-align:right;"><strong class="ctaRedChevron">›</strong> <a href="https://www.smooth-on.com/product-line/sorta-clear/">Click here for more SORTA-Clear™ silicone products.</a></h3></div>






<div class="gallery"><a name="gallery"></a>
	<h2>Gallery</h2>
	<div class="slide-gallery">
		<ul>
							<li class="oneminvid">839089979</li>
						<li><img src="//www.smooth-on.com/images/5489/sortaclear_gallery_01.jpg" /></li><li><img src="//www.smooth-on.com/images/5489/sortaclear_gallery_02.jpg" /></li><li><img src="//www.smooth-on.com/images/5489/sortaclear_gallery_03.jpg" /></li><li><img src="//www.smooth-on.com/images/5489/sortaclear_gallery_04.jpg" /></li><li><img src="//www.smooth-on.com/images/5489/sortaclear_gallery_05.jpg" /></li><li><img src="//www.smooth-on.com/images/5489/sortaclear_gallery_06.jpg" /></li><li><img src="//www.smooth-on.com/images/5489/sortaclear_gallery_07.jpg" /></li><li><img src="//www.smooth-on.com/images/5489/sortaclear_gallery_08.jpg" /></li><li><img src="//www.smooth-on.com/images/5489/sortaclear_gallery_09.jpg" /></li>		</ul>
